{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep remote exports out of checkpoint callbacks**\n\n`onOperationChange` runs synchronously while checkpoint processing still holds its polling lock and before poller futures complete. ON_CHANGE transforms, S3/CloudWatch calls, and flushes can therefore stall durable progress for network timeout duration. Queue/coalesce detached snapshots here and drain them outside checkpoint processing, with delayed-exporter coordination coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0amr","finding_digest":"bc70e659378e613de7bdb3b2633e5192cc833438fddfe77f4a591b9e4288a471","finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","line":159,"observation_digest":"1d6dc1adad4b8f5757487eac9f30254836ef27e70d263fc1f40f94a1bac11acb","observation_id":"aro_v1_dvw4dlnnjohvov2ip2wj6mbfja","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:25:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":151,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_xjmjmo3hpotetkikei7mfe5p5g","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:25:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
